questions.question_text:
Consider the following C program:
#include <stdio.h>
int main(){
int a = 6;
int b = 0;
while(a < 10) {
a = a / 12 + 1;
a += b;}
printf(”%d”, a);
return 0;}
Which one of the following statements is CORRECT?

